<%- include('partials/header') %>
  <h1><%= title %></h1>
  <p class="intro">Use the navigation at the top of each page to explore the website.</p>

  <section>
    <h2>Finding your way around</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Home explains the current availability of the website.</li>
      <li>Create booking opens the form for a new booking.</li>
      <li>Bookings lists the bookings saved in the database.</li>
      <li>About describes the project and its purpose.</li>
      <li>Help explains how to use the current pages.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Select Home or the website name in the header to return to the starting page.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Creating a booking</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Open <a href="/bookings/create">Create booking</a>.</li>
      <li>Enter a name, a person ID of exactly 10 characters, and the session date and time.</li>
      <li>Enter the fixed demo card details shown beside the card fields.</li>
      <li>Select Save booking. If a value is invalid, correct the form and submit it again.</li>
      <li>After saving, the Bookings page opens with a confirmation and the saved booking.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>Person IDs can contain letters and can be used for more than one booking.
      Use fictional details when trying this student project. Do not enter real card details.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Demo card details</h2>
    <p>Demo only. Use card number <strong>4111111111111111</strong>, expiry
      <strong>12/2030</strong> and security code <strong>123</strong>.
      No payment is taken, and other card details are rejected.</p>
    <p>The fictional number and expiry are stored with the booking. The security code
      is checked but not stored. If the form has an error, all three card fields are
      cleared; enter the sample details again after correcting the error.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Session times</h2>
    <p>Enter times in Europe/Dublin time. Bookings are displayed in that same time zone,
      including seasonal clock changes. A repeated time at the autumn clock change
      means the first occurrence. A time skipped at the spring clock change is rejected.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Viewing bookings</h2>
    <p>Open <a href="/bookings">Bookings</a> directly or use the navigation.
      Each booking shows the person's name, ID, session time and creation time.
      If no bookings exist, the page explains how to create the first one.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>If a page does not open</h2>
    <p>For a missing page, use the navigation to return to a known page.
      If you see a server error, try again later.</p>
  </section>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
